---
layout: layouts/_base.njk
title: "Updates"
description: "Blog posts, announcements, papers, Salons and podcast episodes from RadicalxChange since 2018."
---
{% import "components/menu.njk" as menu %}
{% import "components/footer.njk" as footer %}
{{ menu.render() }}
<main id="main">

<section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap">
<div><h1>Read and watch.</h1><p class="lede">Everything the Foundation has published since 2018: blog, announcements, papers, Salons and the podcast. Filter by kind, or scroll by year.</p></div>
<div class="aside">Subscribe to the <a href="#newsletter">newsletter</a> for one email a month. Podcast on <a href="https://feeds.simplecast.com/Tf4D47Lm">Simplecast</a>; video on <a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxRk8v1Wcxa1TIKTvqrtSOw">YouTube</a>.</div>
</div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap">
<div class="section-head"><div><h2>Latest Salons</h2></div><a class="more" href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxRk8v1Wcxa1TIKTvqrtSOw">All videos</a></div>
<ul class="list">
<li><a href="https://youtu.be/9jyJux9ML3g">RadicalxChange Salon: The Plural Stack</a><span class="meta"><i>Salon</i> Rebuilding our digital foundations from protocol up, September 2026</span></li>
<li><a href="https://youtu.be/OZqXrjwF3nE">RadicalxChange Salon: Reverse Alignment</a><span class="meta"><i>Salon</i> Building institutions in the shape of their tools, September 2026</span></li>
</ul>
</div></section>
<section class="section tint"><div class="wrap">
<div class="section-head"><div><h2>Papers</h2><p>Published by the Foundation, by our team and board, or the founding academic work the mechanisms rest on.</p></div></div>
<ul class="list">
{% for chunk in collections.media %}{% if chunk.filter == "papers" %}{% for p in chunk.items %}
<li><a href="{{ p.url }}">{{ p.title | replace("⿻ ", "") }}</a><span class="meta"><i class="b">Paper</i> {% if p.postAuthor %}{{ p.postAuthor }}, {% endif %}{% if p.publisher %}{{ p.publisher }}, {% endif %}{{ p.date | truncate(4, true, "") }}</span></li>
{% endfor %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
</ul>
</div></section>
<section class="section" id="archive"><div class="wrap">
<div class="section-head"><div><h2>Blog, announcements, podcast and video</h2></div></div>
<div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter updates">
<button type="button" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All</button>
<button type="button" data-filter="blog" aria-pressed="false">Blog</button>
<button type="button" data-filter="announcement" aria-pressed="false">Announcements</button>
<button type="button" data-filter="podcast" aria-pressed="false">Podcast and video</button>
</div>
<div id="archive-list">
{% set year = "" %}
{% for chunk in collections.media %}{% if chunk.filter == "all" %}{% for item in chunk.items %}{% if item.postType in ["Blog Post", "Announcement", "Podcast", "Video"] %}
{% set y = item.date | truncate(4, true, "") %}
{% if y != year %}{% if year != "" %}</ul>{% endif %}<p class="year">{{ y }}</p><ul class="list">{% set year = y %}{% endif %}
{% set kind = "blog" if item.postType == "Blog Post" else ("announcement" if item.postType == "Announcement" else "podcast") %}
<li data-kind="{{ kind }}"><a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.postHeader or item.title }}</a><span class="meta"><i{% if kind != "blog" %} class="b"{% endif %}>{{ "Blog" if kind == "blog" else item.postType }}</i>{% if item.postAuthor and item.postAuthor != "RxC Team" %} {{ item.postAuthor }},{% endif %} {{ item.readableDate }}</span></li>
{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
{% if year != "" %}</ul>{% endif %}
</div>
</div></section>
</main>
{{ footer.render() }}
<script>
(function(){const bs=document.querySelectorAll('.filters button');const list=document.getElementById('archive-list');
bs.forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{bs.forEach(x=>x.setAttribute('aria-pressed',x===b));const f=b.dataset.filter;
list.querySelectorAll('li').forEach(li=>li.hidden=!(f==='all'||li.dataset.kind===f));
list.querySelectorAll('.year').forEach(y=>{let u=y.nextElementSibling;y.hidden=!u||![...u.children].some(li=>!li.hidden);});}));})();
</script>